Package: voov-meeting
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libnss3, libx11-6, desktop-file-utils, libpulse0, libgcrypt20, libdbus-1-3, libsystemd0, libudev1
Recommends: xdg-utils, libnotify-bin
Suggests: pipewire
Maintainer: Homin Luo <homin.ro@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/hominluo/voov-meeting-linux
Description: VooV Meeting (unofficial native Linux build)
 VooV Meeting is Tencent's international video-conferencing client.
 .
 Tencent ships VooV only for Windows and macOS; its official Linux client
 is the China-only Tencent Meeting. This package takes that official client
 (Tencent Meeting @APP_VERSION@ for Linux), patches its regional settings
 and endpoint tables so it connects to VooV's servers, and packages it with
 native Linux desktop integration. No Wine is involved.
 .
 This is an unofficial community build. The bundled application is
 proprietary Tencent software; only the packaging and helper scripts are
 MIT licensed.